                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Ultrasonic: yes with hard water. Evaporative: no</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr class="bg-white border-b border-gray-100">
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 font-black text-gray-900">Typical power draw</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Roughly 200 to 400 watts</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Roughly 20 to 50 watts</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr class="bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-100">
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 font-black text-gray-900">Best for</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Adult rooms, hard water, no kids or pets</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Bedrooms, nurseries, large rooms, low running cost</td>
